26
00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:11.460
and especially here what we call the wings of the sphenoid,

27
00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:14.680
but also the point where the eye will settle.

28
00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:18.280
It's the support of the eye, the sphenoid.

29
00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.500
The sphenoid is very important for the stability of the eye.

30
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.140
As it grows, the mesenchyme...

31
00:01:24.211 --> 00:01:25.791
that is above, the bony capsule

32
00:01:26.531 --> 00:01:27.531
