73
00:02:48.422 --> 00:02:52.562
So we see here, you see, the growth, the importance of this growth.

74
00:02:52.782 --> 00:02:55.262
And look at the cephalic part.

75
00:02:55.602 --> 00:02:59.122
It is at the moment when this cephalic part will really begin to grow

76
00:02:59.122 --> 00:03:01.802
